the band foretold by the inscription upon the tomb of Nebuchadnezzar II.

either a band dreaming it is a collection of four butterflies, or four butterflies dreaming they are a band.

touring regularly between rebirths.

a band that plays only in time signatures associated with the numerology of the Book of Acts.

a manifold with Ricci flatness and an arbitrary number of complex dimensions.

a complete musical system capable of explaining itself.

a systematic method of dissovling both subject and object into a single perpetual stew.
